Access Parquet files
The dataset viewer converts every dataset on the Hub to the Parquet format. The /parquet
endpoint returns a JSON list of the Parquet URLs for a dataset:
import requests
API_URL = "https://datasets-server.huggingface.co/parquet?dataset=cornell-movie-review-data/rotten_tomatoes"
def query():
response = requests.get(API_URL)
return response.json()
data = query()
